ns\"><a class=\"hBw1pG_iconBtn\" aria-label=\"Account\" href=\"/account\"><svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M20 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H8a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"></circle></svg></a><a class=\"hBw1pG_iconBtn\" aria-label=\"Wishlist\" href=\"/account?tab=wishlist\"><svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M20.84 4.61a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.78 0L12 5.67l-1.06-1.06a5.5 5.5 0 0 0-7.78 7.78l1.06 1.06L12 21.23l7.78-7.78 1.06-1.06a5.5 5.5 0 0 0 0-7.78z\"></path></svg></a><a class=\"hBw1pG_cartBtn\" aria-label=\"Cart\" href=\"/cart\"><svg width=\"18\" height=\"18\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"21\" r=\"1\"></circle><circle cx=\"20\" cy=\"21\" r=\"1\"></circle><path d=\"M1 1h4l2.68 13.39a2 2 0 0 0 2 1.61h9.72a2 2 0 0 0 2-1.61L23 6H6\"></path></svg><span class=\"hBw1pG_cartCount\">0</span></a></div><button class=\"hBw1pG_mobileMenuBtn\" aria-label=\"Open menu\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><line x1=\"3\" y1=\"12\" x2=\"21\" y2=\"12\"></line><line x1=\"3\" y1=\"6\" x2=\"21\" y2=\"6\"></line><line x1=\"3\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"21\" y2=\"18\"></line></svg></button></div></div></header><main style=\"flex:1 0 auto\"><div class=\"pgaT6G_support\"><div class=\"pgaT6G_header\"><div class=\"container pgaT6G_headerContainer\"><h1>How can we help?</h1><div class=\"pgaT6G_searchBar\"><input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"Search for articles, guides, or FAQs...\"/><button>Search</button></div></div></div><div class=\"container pgaT6G_content\"><div class=\"pgaT6G_imageWrapper\"><img src=\"/images/support.png\" alt=\"Customer Support\" class=\"pgaT6G_supportImage\"/></div><div class=\"pgaT6G_grid\"><div class=\"pgaT6G_card\"><h3>Account &amp; Billing</h3><p>Manage your payment methods, subscriptions, and invoice history.</p></div><div class=\"pgaT6G_card\"><h3>Licensing</h3><p>Understand how you can use our digital products in your commercial projects.</p></div><div class=\"pgaT6G_card\"><h3>Technical Support</h3><p>Troubleshoot issues with software installations, bugs, or compatibility.</p></div><div class=\"pgaT6G_card\"><h3>Refunds</h3><p>Read about our 30-day money back guarantee and how to request a return.</p></div></div><div class=\"pgaT6G_faqSection\"><h2 class=\"h2 mb-6\" style=\"text-align:center\">Frequently Asked Questions</h2><div class=\"pgaT6G_faqList\"><div class=\"pgaT6G_faqItem\"><h3>How do I download a product after purchase?</h3><p>Once your payment is confirmed, you will receive an email with a direct download link. You can also log into your account and navigate to the &#x27;Downloads&#x27; section to access all your purchased files anytime.</p></div><div class=\"pgaT6G_faqItem\"><h3>Can I use the digital products for commercial work?</h3><p>Yes. All products labeled with a &#x27;Standard License&#x27; can be used for commercial work, including client projects, provided you do not redistribute the raw files.</p></div><div class=\"pgaT6G_faqItem\"><h3>Do you offer refunds?</h3><p>We offer a 30-day money-back guarantee for any software that fails to function as advertised. Since digital goods are non-returnable by nature, we do not typically issue refunds for &quot;change of mind&quot;.</p></div></div></div></div></div><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer class=\"S6Hkya_footer\"><div class=\"container undefined\"><div class=\"S6Hkya_grid\"><div class=\"S6Hkya_brandCol\"><a class=\"S6Hkya_logo\" href=\"/\">Method<span class=\"S6Hkya_dot\">.</span></a><p class=\"S6Hkya_description\">The premium marketplace f